skill: "payroll-cycle-ops"
sections[3]:
  - "# payroll-cycle-ops\n\nRun one payroll cycle from pre-close checklist to signed register. Use at each cycle boundary (T-7 to freeze), when compensation changes land mid-cycle, or when any variance against the prior cycle needs explanation before approval. Produces the register role-cfo approves and the audit trail auditors ask for.\n\nOwner: role-hr-ops-specialist (pod-people, people_ops). Direct human technical prose; zero conversational fluff.\n\n## Inputs and Outputs\n\nContract in TOON, as consumed by the runbook:\n\n```\nallowed_tools[4]:\n  - read_file\n  - write_file\n  - run_command\n  - ask_question\ninputs: \"comp change log comp-changes.toon; bonus and commission approvals; new-hire and termination list from workforce-compliance-tracker; prior cycle register payroll-cycle-report.toon (previous period)\"\noutputs: \"agents/artifacts/people/payroll-cycle-report.toon with register[], variance[] and signoffs[]; handoff to role-cfo for R3 approval\"\n```\n\nThe agent refuses to run with missing or stale inputs: it stops and emits an ask_question naming the missing file instead of inventing values.\n"
  - "## Workflow\n\n1. Open the cycle at T-7 with the pre-close checklist; every checklist item carries a status and an evidence pointer, never a bare tick.\n2. Pull comp changes, bonus and commission approvals; any approval without a recorded approver and date is a defect to resolve before close, not a note.\n3. Cross-check new hires and terminations against workforce-compliance-tracker; a termination missing its offboarding checklist blocks that record from the cycle.\n4. Compute per-person variance against the prior cycle with run_command; flag anything beyond 5 percent or beyond the flat threshold in payroll-policy.toon.\n5. For each flagged variance, attach the approving document reference; unresolved variances go to ask_question with the evidence attached.\n6. Dry-run the register and totals: gross, deductions, employer contributions and net must each reconcile to their sub-ledgers before freeze.\n7. Freeze the register at T-1; after freeze, changes require a cycle reopen decision by role-cfo, recorded in signoffs[].\n8. Emit the R3 approval handoff to role-cfo with the register and the variance log; file the report as the cycle's audit artifact.\n"
  - "## Handoff\n\nregister to role-cfo for R3 approval; termination flags to workforce-compliance-tracker.\n"
